• **Draggable Regions**: Custom titlebars require CSS styling to tell Chromium where the window can be grabbed and dragged:
\begin{lstlisting}[caption={CSS Window Dragging Directives}]
/* Make custom titlebar draggable across the desktop */
.custom-titlebar {
 -webkit-app-region: drag;
 user-select: none;
}

/* Ensure interactive buttons inside titlebar remain clickable */
.custom-titlebar button {
 -webkit-app-region: no-drag;
}
\end{lstlisting}
